<title>USA: US corn gluten meal weaker, feed prices unchanged.</title>
<headline>US corn gluten meal weaker, feed prices unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten feed values were unchanged, while some dealers reported lower gluten meal values linked to increased supply and sagging demand.</p>
